# Optional server-side override; never prefix with VITE_ (keys stay on the server).
# Public default: Private.coffee. A configured provider is tried first, then the public default.
# Set in Vercel Production and Preview, then redeploy. No key is needed for the public default.
# OVERPASS_URL=https://your-overpass-instance.example/api/interpreter
# NOMINATIM_URL=https://your-nominatim-instance.example/search
# ORS_API_KEY=your-openrouteservice-key
